    // Record every ai_terminal session as an asciicast v3 file under
    // log_root's asciinema_casts_for_troubleshooting_rendering folder.
    // Off by default for a public release; set true globally, or set
    // "record_asciicast": true on a specific profile, to opt in. Legacy
    // per-profile AI_TERMINAL_LOG_LINES values remain supported but are
    // deprecated. Resolution is profile override, then global, then true
    // (the "true" fallback only applies if this key is removed entirely).
